   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">As used in this report, "First Northwest" refers to First Northwest Bancorp and "First Fed"&#160;or "Bank"&#160;refers to First Fed Bank, the wholly owned subsidiary of First Northwest. The terms "we,"&#160;"our," "us,"&#160;and "Company"&#160;refer to First Northwest together with First Fed, unless the context indicates otherwise.</p>
