   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">(<em style="font: inherit;">1</em>)&#160;Term loans that are renewed or extended for periods longer than <em style="font: inherit;">90</em> days are presented as a new origination in the year of most recent renewal or extension.</p>
