    </div>
   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">The following table&#160;presents information regarding our borrowings as of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>. The table&#160;includes both long- and short-term borrowings.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 6pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
