    </div>
   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The following amounts were recorded on the Consolidated Balance Sheet related to cumulative basis adjustment for fair value hedges for the periods shown.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 6pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
