     <td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 94%;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">statements regarding our business plans, prospects, growth and operating strategies;</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
