     <td style="width: 3%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#8226;</td>
     <td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 94%;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">statements regarding the quality of our loan and investment portfolios;</p> </td>
