     <td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 32%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Investment securities</p> </td>
