  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;"><b>Noninterest Income. </b>Noninterest income decreased $1.9 million, or 32.5%, to&#160;$4.0 million for the&#160;six months ended June 30, 2026, from&#160;$6.0 million for the&#160;six months ended June 30, 2025. Nonrecurring income for the first half of 2025&#160;included a $1.1 million BOLI death benefit, an $846,000 gain on the extinguishment of debt related to repurchasing $5.0 million of subordinated debt at a discount recorded in other income and $81,000 of interest related to an Employee Retention Credit recorded in other income. Also included in other income was a&#160;period-over-period decrease&#160;in swap fee income of $113,000.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
  <div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
