     <td colspan="16" style="font-size: 10pt; width: 78%;"> <p style="font-size: 9pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 9pt; text-indent: -9pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">(1) Shares repurchased by the Company during the quarter represent shares acquired from restricted stock award participants in connection with the cancellation of restricted stock to pay withholding taxes upon vesting totaling 0 shares, 1,859 shares, and 0 shares, respectively, for the periods indicated.</p> </td>
     <td style="font-size: 10pt; width: 1%;">&#160;</td>
