   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">During the fiscal quarter ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148826473"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148826480"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148826481"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148826482">no</span></span></span></span> director or officer of First Northwest adopted or terminated a "Rule <em style="font: inherit;">10b5</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em> trading arrangement" or "non-Rule <em style="font: inherit;">10b5</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em> trading arrangement," as each term is defined in Item <em style="font: inherit;">408</em>(a) of Regulation S-K.</p>
